---
// "…and I hope you have a [nice] [day]!" — the adjective is a slot-machine
// reel behind a small pane of glass (spins on arrival; click/tap/Enter to spin
// again) and the time word follows the viewer's local time. Behaviour lives
// in src/scripts/greeting.ts; without JavaScript it reads "a nice day".
---

I hope you have a <button
  type="button"
  class="slot"
  data-slot
  aria-label="nice — spin for another adjective"
  title="Spin again"
  ><span class="slot-window" aria-hidden="true"><span class="slot-strip"><span>nice</span></span></span><svg
    class="slot-hint"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="2.5"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-3-6.7L21 8"></path><path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path></svg
  ></button
> <span data-daypart>day</span>!

<script>
  import "../scripts/greeting";
</script>
